      "ruleId": "BA2018",
      "createdDate": "2026-11-22 00:00:00Z",
      "justification": "BA2018 (EnableSafeSEH) on legacy x86 v8jsi.dll, Release symbol copy (out/symbols/x86-Release/v8jsi.dll). clang-cl emits no SafeSEH tables (.sxdata), and V8's x86 hand-written asm is not SafeSEH-aware, so the linker cannot produce a /SAFESEH image. An x86 toolchain limitation, not a v8-jsi defect; accepted as a residual. Signature is per binary and per configuration."
    },
